    "body": "Cause: Arrow Up and Arrow Down changed the coefficient directly, while typed edits emitted the `input` event used by the shared graph redraw listener. The model changed, but the graph did not receive its redraw signal.\n\nArrow-key edits now use the same live-input path as typing. A hidden FF8 interaction check focused a STR coefficient, sent Arrow Up, and confirmed that the number and graph path both changed immediately while focus stayed in the same input. This applies to Character and Enemy curve controls that use the shared FF8 number input.",
